{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 2"},"body":"The formal source covers a negative-fiber branch, not the full headline inequalities.\n\nInspected: Inspected StratumSmoothFibration (surjective, connected fibers and smooth strata off the boundary), FiberModel, VeryGenerally, and the configured vanishing/equality conclusion; compared audited upper-bound and additivity statements.\n\nCapture rebinding by Codex, 26 October 2026: the Atlas capture revision changed after an outside-report wording correction. The pinned Lean text, configuration, paper text and proposed relation are unchanged; no new review is implied.","content_sha256":"sha256:e4f9876a96f93be5474aeca0ae7b51f6ebace46d7d17ac1bc08465cb232a8966","fingerprint":"sha256:2130a09678aeb60b231df92cdc85032e55d19d48ed8f2758705184a5d17c1e57","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. The formal source covers a negative-fiber branch, not the full headline inequalities.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:b1a7cd8492a13f02998bd029cfea7952bf6a59344d3d67981e0d30059ef034aa","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.ReverseLogKodaira.SmoothProjectiveVariety.veryGenerally_fiber_negative_branch"],"explanation":"The formal assertion specializes to very general fibers whose logarithmic Kodaira dimension is minus infinity, then asserts vanishing of every positive pluriform section on the total space. This is the fiber-negative branch of the paper upper-bound theorem, whose vanishing clause also covers a negative base term.","fingerprint":"sha256:debbb1385d2ebb6eed5e8d627512e37e3761a86ceca771722f179421695dab49","limitations":"The formal assertion does not cover the finite-Kodaira upper bound or the base-negative branch; the scheme and pluriform representations have not been independently verified.","relation":"formal-is-part","row_id":"The-reverse-logarithmic-Kodaira-inequality-and-additivity-September-26-2026#thm:upper-bound","statement_sha256":"sha256:d12cd301c897d1c19dd3852779b74a16cc1f53712c6a4e1297b59294a9c029aa"},{"declarations":["OAI.ReverseLogKodaira.SmoothProjectiveVariety.veryGenerally_fiber_negative_branch"],"explanation":"The same configured declaration asserts equality of the total logarithmic Kodaira dimension with the base-plus-fiber expression only when the fiber dimension is bottom. This is the negative-fiber specialization of the stated general additivity formula.","fingerprint":"sha256:619affeace7f9f0af284f55988c102ff650d29012c777e00ef28f3d075a5385c","limitations":"Do not label the full log-additivity theorem formalized: other Kodaira-dimension branches are absent.","relation":"formal-is-part","row_id":"The-reverse-logarithmic-Kodaira-inequality-and-additivity-September-26-2026#cor:additivity","statement_sha256":"sha256:5bbbb6e3890c86b4b872013e4cd2731d8c130a31cfe16c4a70b824894c9caf32"}]},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"references":["https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/LogKodairaFiberNegative.lean","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-reverse-logarithmic-Kodaira-inequality-and-additivity-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L30","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-reverse-logarithmic-Kodaira-inequality-and-additivity-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L51"],"release_id":"openai-math","review_state":"unreviewed","row_id":"c